{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>據圖片顯示，該「手辦」為特斯拉旗下車型與上海「三件套」的模型。</p>\n<p>陶琳稱，這本來是同事們閒暇時利用邊角料創意的興趣之作，沒想到成就了一件絕佳心意。她還透露，「Elon 很喜歡這個設計，特斯拉人不僅僅會造車，浪漫起來也這麼硬核，這是上海工廠的特別『交付』，也是中國精密製造的魅力」。</p>\n<p>圖片顯示，特斯拉公司汽車業務高級副總裁、大中華區總裁朱曉彤陪同馬斯克到訪。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/front20261120ac/350/w690h460/20261120/da37-65b7ad732906e7248e1d03e26a77c92e.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/front20261120ac/278/w690h388/20261120/5c38-25923cc85e70cc5fde84b03930728ff6.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/front20261120ac/350/w690h460/20261120/a926-9c4964e5967731985f6443ea2c40d0bf.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/front20261120ac/350/w690h460/20261120/da37-65b7ad732906e7248e1d03e26a77c92e.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/front20261120ac/278/w690h388/20261120/5c38-25923cc85e70cc5fde84b03930728ff6.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/front20261120ac/350/w690h460/20261120/a926-9c4964e5967731985f6443ea2c40d0bf.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:43:57.669504+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":6,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:04:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:21.829279+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:18.728787+00:00","content_hash":"a7e2e9c53c63b70fe203df02525871dc19b61a3166b891ac23da254ba2a90c31","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}